@startuml 04_Use_Case_Settlement
title Use Cases - Balances and Settlement (D21, D23, D24, D34, D39, D40)
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Active Member" as Member
actor "Debtor" as Debtor
actor "Creditor" as Creditor
Member <|-- Debtor
Member <|-- Creditor

rectangle "Settlement" {
  usecase "View per-group net balances" as S1
  usecase "View simplified settlement plan" as S2
  usecase "Prepare settlement\n(see amount + finality warning)" as S3
  usecase "Record full settlement" as S4
  usecase "Recalculate current obligation\n(stale amount adjustment)" as S5
  usecase "View payment history" as S6
  usecase "Edit / delete / reverse payment" as S7
}

Member --> S1
Member --> S2
Member --> S6
Debtor --> S3
Debtor --> S4
S4 ..> S5 : <<include>>
Creditor --> S6
Creditor -[#red,dashed]-> S4 : not allowed (D39)
Member -[#red,dashed]-> S7 : not allowed for anyone (D40)

note right of S5
  Amount = full current obligation for
  (debtor, creditor) in the current plan.
  Zero -> no payment created (D24).
end note
note right of S2
  Per group only; never offset across
  groups (D21). Derived, not stored (D34).
end note
@enduml
